  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.0.3:\n\n## Fixed\n- [Export] Fixed an issue where tables that span the full page width in DOCX did not span the full width in PDF export. (DOC-7466)\n- Fixed an issue where tables could shift position when merging documents using `MergeDocuments()`. (DOC-7475)",
